    "method": "Python standard library arithmetic from explicit source ElementDB C/H/N/O mono masses and ResidueDB I/F/S/Q/V/G/K full formulas. Full residue sum in C,H,N,O order minus water; prefix/suffix accumulation is proton-first, ion offset last. Source formula pointer iteration can differ in final binary64 rounding; tests allow1e-9absolute for source-derived error metrics and do not assert exact predicted mass bits as C++ output.",
