  "source_limits": [
    "Source all-equal intensities do not specify std::sort tie order; native stable sorting keeps m/z order after initial sort.",
    "Source DataValue equality for 12.1 does not mean f32 measured intensity sums are exactly 12.1. Native expected sum is 11*f64(f32(1.1)).",
    "Source topN_MSEfragmenterror literal0 is rounded/weak. Independent errors have positive MSE.",
    "ClassTest relative/absolute defaults are unavailable in this snapshot; test tolerances are stated explicitly.",
    "Source chained nth_element ranges are undefined for matched n1/2/3; intended sorted-order indices are a native safe extension, not upstream numerical goldens.",
    "Source topN1 sample deviation and enabled zero-denominator ratios are nonfinite; native atomic errors are checked boundaries.",
    "Source boolean precursor_in_ms2 and fragment_mass_tolerance_ppm arguments promote to DataValue(int), since DataValue has no bool constructor. Typed hit metadata preserves integer 0/1; the native spectrum string map projects that integer as \"0\"/\"1\". Fixture bool kind records the original assertion literal, not the stored type."
  ],
