  "independent_tests": {
    "count": 7,
    "source_literal_tolerances": "Totals: 1e-6; rounded weak MSE zero: 1e-6; N/C ratios: 1e-6; other fractional source statistics: 1e-7. Integer/zero assertions otherwise exact. Positive derived MSE and derived error metrics are checked separately within 1e-9.",
    "controlled_error_cases": "Offsets 0.125, 0.25, 0.5, 1.0 and intensities 1, 2, 4, 8 yield exact binary statistics; mathematical variance uses sum(x^2)-sum(x)^2/N, divided by N-1.",
    "small_n": "For n=1/2/3, median and IQR expected from intended sorted indices are checked native extensions; top N=1 with nonempty errors must fail atomically.",
    "ppm_duplicate": "AG b1 at charges 1/2, measured m/z 50 and tolerance 1e6 ppm: sorted theory b1++ then b1+ both match the same peak; arrays/all-peaks keep b1+, matched-only keeps both.",
    "ion_naming": "Selected original literals plus source-branch deductions; full direct IonNaming class-test coverage belongs to the separate implementation suite."
